lingu kwasowego poprawia jakość i strukturę skóry, wygładza ją, redukuje niedoskonałości oraz dodaje zdrowego blasku. Działa również przeciwstarzeniowo i zapewnia długotrwałe nawilżenie.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-x7yqe8kwhj" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-x7yqe8kwhj"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Jakie kwasy zawiera peeling kwasowy Routines?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="1"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-mrdsfxux8qa" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Peeling kwasowy zawiera kwas migdałowy i azelainowy, a także kompleks Apibreeze™ składający się z kwasu laktobionowego, glukonolaktonu i miodu pszczelego.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-u9887ejbef8" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-u9887ejbef8"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Jak często powinno się stosować peeling kwasowy?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="2"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-pp4znlczssm" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Zaleca się stosowanie peelingu kwasowego 2 razy w tygodniu.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-ttzcotpmoi" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-ttzcotpmoi"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Jak prawidłowo stosować peeling kwasowy?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="3"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-4fgtaxsshs7" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Nałóż niewielką ilość produktu na oczyszczoną i suchą skórę twarzy. Zmyj pozostałości letnią wodą po 3-5 minutach, następnie stonizuj skórę i zaaplikuj serum lub krem.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-6sitkpti68n" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-6sitkpti68n"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Czy peeling kwasowy jest odpowiedni dla skóry wrażliwej?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="4"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-cg22lmhtf4d" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Tak, peeling kwasowy jest odpowiedni dla skóry wrażliwej. Zawiera składniki minimalizujące ryzyko podrażnień, takie jak Apibreeze™.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-u5qtsq3kja" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-u5qtsq3kja"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Czy peeling kwasowy można stosować przez cały rok?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="5"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-k7iix6j6qt" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Tak, peeling kwasowy jest przeznaczony do całorocznej pielęgnacji skóry. Należy jednak pamiętać o stosowaniu kremu z filtrem SPF50 w ciągu dnia.&nbsp;</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-1tugw3pqm2x" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-1tugw3pqm2x"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Czy peeling kwasowy może być stosowany podczas ciąży?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="6"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-f35zi9e823b" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Peeling kwasowy zawiera kwasy AHA i inne składniki aktywne, dlatego przed jego stosowaniem w ciąży zaleca się konsultację z lekarzem.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-ozpjnjhyf3m" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-ozpjnjhyf3m"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items" data-target="#undefined"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 448 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M432 256C432 269.3 421.3 280 408 280H40c-13.25 0-24-10.74-24-23.99C16 242.8 26.75 232 40 232h368C421.3 232 432 242.8 432 256z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title" data-image="false"></span><div class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Jak długo należy trzymać peeling kwasowy na skórze?</div></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="7"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-5g4w7fnscfg" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="1"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Peeling kwasowy należy trzymać na skórze przez 3-5 minut, a następnie zmyć letnią wodą.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div></div></div> </div></div> </div></div></div></div> </div><div class="ecom-section__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div> </section>
